<title>NEW ZEALAND: Owens Group first half profit up slightly.</title>
<headline>Owens Group first half profit up slightly.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr result to Sept 30.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    4.93 vs 4.73</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   7.78 vs 8.12</p>
<p>    Div (cents)			    4.0 vs same</p>
<p>    Turnover			     194.5 vs 197.8</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			 7.34 vs 6.80</p>
<p>    Tax				     2.32 vs 2.34</p>
<p>    Equity earnings		     0.08 vs 0.43</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)   62.75 vs same</p>
<p>Dividend carries full imputation credit.</p>
<p>Pay date Jan 24</p>
<p>Reg date Jan 17</p>
<p>    Ex div   Jan 20</p>
<p>Note - Owens Group Ltd is a transport company.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
